  <title>Deposits report</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Deposits</gui></guiseq> lists every bank
  deposit made in <link xref="deposits"/>, with its date and amount. Open a
  deposit to see the customer payments that went into it. The window menu has
  <gui>Expand all</gui>, <gui>Collapse all</gui> and <gui>Export to
  pdf</gui>.</p>

</page>
